        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9024P, Ultima Milan Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Milan Door Handle has a very appealing rectangular shape that makes it a great choice for modern homes. This Ultima Collection Milan Pull is available in 12 inch and 18 inch center to center lengths. Choose from an array of contemporary finish color options. The Omnia Ultima II 9024P Door Pull is made out of solid brass with the attention to detail and quality that you would expect. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia Milan Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>9024P/305:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 13\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9024P/457:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 19\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia 9024P Pull is also available as a <a href=\"/products/back-to-back-modern-milan-door-pull-set-omnia-btb-9024p\"><b>Back to Back Mounted Pair</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-C08PC3_size.gif?v=1704354638\" width=\"600\" height=\"144\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>",
